{ Can White save the game ? } 1. Ng8
{ The knight should stay close to the king: this move allows for a simple defence.   79.Ng4 ?  is a ridiculous decision. Even though the winning procedure is not always easy, moving the knight away from the king is usually suicidal.  Rh4   79...Rh3 !  is less natural but thirteen moves faster.  80.Ne3  Re4  81.Ng2  Kf5   81...Kf6 !  immediately wins the knight by zugzwang:  82.Kg8  Rg4+  .  82.Kf7  Kg4  83.Kf6  Re2  0-1.   See Ending 8. }
