{ Can Black win the game ? } 1... Ke6
{ Black can win in a fairly typical way; the f4-pawn precludes any stalemate motifs, while promoting to a knight in the corner is insufficient. }
2. h7
{ The other variation involving promoting to a knight goes   77.Kg7  Ke7  78.h7  Rg1+  79.Kh6  Kf7 !  80.h8=N+  Kf6  -+ }
2... Rg1+ 3. Kh6 Kf7 4. h8=N+ Kf6 5. Kh7 Rg7+ 6. Kh6 Rg4 7. Kh7 Rxf4 8. Kg8
{ 83.Ng6  Rf1  84.Nf8  Kf7 } 8... Ra4 9. Kh7 Rg4 { 0-1.  See Ending 9. } *

