[SetUp "1"]

1. Rf8+
{ The rook carries out a useful tempo-gaining manoeuvre by first giving check and only then placing itself behind the pawn, forcing the enemy king to lose precious time. This manoeuvre can be decisive if the king is two ranks in front of the pawn, as it is forced to move back. }
1... Ke3 2. Rg8 Kf3 3. Kd3 { White wins.  See Ending 24. } *

