{ What result may Black hope for ? } 1... Rf5
{ Black should have settled for a draw by moving the king closer:   64...Ke3 !  65.Ke7   65.Ke6  Kf4 !  66.g6  Kg5 !  67.g7 ! =  65...Kf4 !  66.g6  Now Black faces an interesting choice:  66...Kf5 !   66...Kg5 ?  67.g7  +-  67.g7  Rg1  68.Kf7  Rg2 = }
2. Ke6 { All of a sudden, White is winning. } 2... Rxg5 3. f7 Rg6+ 4. Ke5
{ 67.Kf5  Rg1 = } 4... Rg5+ 5. Ke4 Rg4+ 6. Kf3 Rg1 7. Kf2
