{ Evaluate the position. } 1... Kf7
{ Black can reach the correct defensive set-up provided he mobilizes the king at once. If Black is hesitant and loses but one tempo, White is allowed to carry out his winning plan.   92...Bg3 ?  loses a fatal tempo:  93.Kb6  Kf7  94.Bd8  Ke6  95.Bc7  Be1  96.Kb7  Kd5  97.Bf4  Ba5  98.Be3  +-  Threatening 99. Bb6, and the king is too late to defend the position. }
2. Bg5 Ke6 3. Ka6 Kd5 4. Kb7 Bg3
