{ Does White have a defence ? } 1. Nf1
{ The side with the knight usually has a hard time trying to hold onto a shaky blockade to control a pawn, but here there is a way to do it. The knight should move out of the way so that the king can attack the pawn. This manoeuvre is explained after the second move in Ending 40.   81.Nc4 ?  White errs.  Kd4  0-1. It's immediate zugzwang.   See Ending 40. }
*

