[FEN "8/2bB4/2P5/6k1/4K3/5P2/8/8 b - - 0 1"]
[SetUp "1"]

1... Bf4 2. Kd5 Kf6 { Preventing Ke6. Black draws. } 3. Ke4 Kg5
{ See Ending 45. } *

