1... Ke5 2. Bf7 Kd4 3. Be6 Kc3 4. Kd1 b3 5. Bf7 Kb2 6. Be6 Ka3 7. Bf5
{ Anticipating the threat. } 7... b2 8. Bb1 { See Ending 47. } *

