{ Is this a winning endgame ? } 1. Kf4
{ The endgame with a strong a- or h-pawn in combination with a central pawn is winning. The way to do this is by bringing the king over by means of a lengthy detour, as shown in the diagram. In this game, the player with the White pieces had been aimlessly shuffling his pieces around for some time, before he hit on the right plan: }
1... Kd5 2. Ke3 Kc4 3. Kd2 Be4 4. Kc1 Bh7 5. Kb2 Bg6 6. Ka3 Bc2 7. Bg7 Bh7 8.
Ka4 Be4 9. Ka5 Kd5 10. Kb6 Bf5 11. Kc7 Be4 12. Kd7 Bh7 13. Ke7 Bd3 14. Be5
{ 1-0.  See Ending 51. } *

