[SetUp "1"]

{ Can Black save the game ? } 1... Bf8
{ Black can draw the game based on a stalemate motif. The pressure on this pawn ensures the draw. Black has no time to put the bishop on the long diagonal and get the king out of the corner:   52...Bf6 ?  53.Bd5 !   53.Kxf4 ?  Kg8 =  would let Black's king out.  53...Bc3  54.Bc4   54.Kxf4 ?  Bd2+ ! =   54.Kf5 ?  f3  55.Bxf3  Kg8  54...Bb2  55.Kf5  f3  56.Ke6 !  f2  57.Kf7  +- }
2. Kh5 Kg8 3. Bf3 Kh8 4. Bd5
{ White thought he had achieved a decisive zugzwang position, but Black now uncorks a brilliant resource. }
4... f3 5. Bxf3 Kg8 6. Be4 Kh8 7. Bd5 Bxh6 { Draw.  See Ending 41. } *

