{ White wins by building the bridge. } 1. Ke7 Re1+ 2. Kd6 Rd1+ 3. Ke6 Re1+ 4.
Kd5 Rd1+ 5. Rd4 { See Ending 53. } *

[Event "?"]
[Site "?"]
