4. Kf6
{ 56.Rb8  Ra4 !   56...g5  57.Rh8+  Kg6  58.Rg8+  Kf7  59.Kf5 =  57.Rh8+  Kg5  58.Rh1  Rh4  59.Rg1+  Kh5  60.Kf6  Rf4+  61.Ke5  g5  -+ }
