{ White can easily draw by either 56. hxg5 or 56. Rf8+. It's interesting to see how quickly White goes down after the comfortable-looking pin:   56.hxg5 !  Re3   56...Kxg5  57.Ke2  57.Rh1 !  Kxg5  58.Re1  is the most comfortable variation. }
1... Kg4 2. Rxg5+ Kxh4 3. Re5
{ 58.Rg8  Re3 !  followed by a rook move on the e-file and advancing the pawn. }
