2. Kg5 { 64.Kg3  Ke5 !  Transposes to the main variation. } 2... Rg8+ 3. Kh5
Rh8+ 4. Kg5 Rg8+ 5. Kh4 Rh8+ 6. Kg3 Ke5 7. Ra6
