{ Can Black save the game ? } 1... h3
{ Black can save the game. As long as he gets the move order right, he can eliminate all of White's pawns.  But not   41...e4 ?  on account of  42.Bxe4 !  fxe4  43.fxe4  Kf4  44.Kh2  and White wins. }
2. gxh3 e4 3. Bxe4 fxe4 4. fxe4
{ White still has two pawns, but Black has time to capture the most dangerous one, after which a drawn endgame is reached with king and pawn vs. lone king. }
4... Kf4 5. h4 Kxe4 { Draw.  See Ending 78. } *

[Event "?"]
[Site "?"]
[Date "????.??.??"]
[Round "?"]
[White "Pawn Endings"]
[Black "JÃ¶rg Dinckel vs. Axel Stephan"]
