{ Can White win? } 1... Ng6
{ This looks so safe, yet it is the only losing move. It's also an unusual move, even for blitz. Any other move draws:   75...Ne6   75...Nh7   75...Nd7 }
2. Rxg6+
{ A well-known simplifying operation, often the only way to win for the side that is an exchange up with material reduced to only one flank. }
2... fxg6+ 3. Ke6 Kh7 4. Kf6 Kh8 5. Kxg6 Kg8 6. Kh6 Kf7 7. g6+ Kg8 8. g7 Kf7 9.
Kh7 Ke7 { Draw. Presumably, Kasparov got flagged here.  See Ending 79. } *

[Event "?"]
[Site "?"]
