[White "Pawn Endings"]
[Black "Matthew Turner vs. Katrine Tjolsen"]
[Result "*"]
[FEN "5k2/5r2/8/2p2R2/8/3PK3/8/8 w - - 0 1"]
[SetUp "1"]

{ Can Black draw after 62.Ke4? } 1. Ke4
{ 62.Ke4 and 62.Rxc5 both lead to a draw, but keeping the rook on is perhaps the most practical choice.   62.Rxc5  Ke8 !  leads to a Philidor position. }
1... Rxf5 2. Kxf5 Kf7 3. Ke5 c4
{ Altering the key squares of the last remaining pawn: Draw.  See Ending 52 & Ending 81. }
*

[Event "?"]
[Site "?"]
