{ Does capturing on e5 ensure a draw for Black ? } 1... Bxe5
{ The easiest way to a draw. } 2. Nxe5 Kxe5 3. b4 Kd6
{ The point. The king is not going to let the pawn promote unhindered. } 4. Ka6
Kc7 5. Ka7 Kc6 { Draw. The game ends with a funny little king dance. } *

[Event "?"]
[Site "?"]
