{ Choose between 58... Kc2 and 58... Kc4. } 1... Kc4
{ Black has a fortress, but must watch out for a sacrifice on g5, which could lead to a winning pawn endgame for White. This is the correct move, when White makes no progress, e.g.   58...Kc2 ?  Black is negligent and forgets about the exchange sacrifice on g5; now he is already lost.  59.Rd5 !  Now the inevitable captures on g5 lead to a winning pawn endgame.  Kc3  60.Rxg5  hxg5  61.Kxe3  Kc4  62.Ke4  Kc5  63.Kf5  Kd6  64.Kxg5  Ke7  65.Kg6  Kf8  66.Kh7  1-0. }
