{ Can Black save the upcoming pawn endgame ? } 1... Kb3
{ Black can draw the pawn ending with a subtle dual-purpose king move at the end of the variation.   47...d5  leads to the same result with similar variations:  48.h8=Q  Rxh8  49.Kxh8  Kb3  50.Kg7  Kxb2  51.Kf6  Kc2  52.Ke5   52.Kxf5  d1=Q  53.Rxd1  Kxd1  54.Ke5  Ke2  55.g4  Ke3 !  transposes to the game  52...d1=Q  53.Rxd1  Kxd1  54.Kxd5  Ke2  55.Ke5  Kf3  and all the pawns are exchanged. }
