{ 58...Kc6 ?  This innocuous-looking move allows White to create an unbreakable fortress.  59.Nd4+  Kd5  60.Kb1  Qd1+  61.Ka2  Kc4  62.Ba1  Qh1  63.Bb2  Qa8+  64.Kb1  Kd3  Draw. }
