{ Is it time to resign ? } 1... Ra7+
{ There is no need for Black to resign here. A stalemate motif, in combination with the fortress seen in the previous exercise, allows for a spectacular rescue.  Directly   65...Ra8 ?  fails to  66.Rb7  +-  . }
2. Kxe8 Ra8 3. Ke7+ Rxb8 4. Bxb8 Kh8 5. Kf6 Kg8 6. Be5 Kf8 { Draw. } *

